- Modify `src/store.js`: add `rateTicket(id, rating)`, the one place that decides "at most one", so production can make it a single conditional update (`UPDATE ... WHERE rating IS NULL`).
- Modify `src/tickets.js:8-20`: new tickets start with `rating: null, rated_at: null`.
