# Plan: customer satisfaction rating

Spec: `docs/specs/csat-rating.md` (approved, Mai Do, 2026-01-12). Written 2026-10-07. Nothing is built yet.
Test command: `npm test` (`node --test`, no dependencies, Node 20+). Execution: inline, one phase per checkpoint; the owner is away, so phases wait for their confirmation of the answers below.

## Goal

A customer rates a resolved ticket 1 to 5 from the portal; a 1 or 2 emails the owning agent; a nightly job
summarises the past seven days per agent; `assignee_id` becomes `owner_id`, without breaking the finance export.

## Phases

